463&ref=A","published_at":"2026-10-02T10:06:00","sentiment":"positive","is_new":true}],"disclosures":[{"date":"2026-10-01T13:09:24","title":"주식등의대량보유상황보고서(일반)","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20261001000182","is_new":false},{"date":"2026-10-01T09:03:49","title":"단일판매ㆍ공급계약체결              ","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20261001800034","is_new":false}],"reports":[],"consensus":{"Q":{"period":"2026년 4분기","latest":330023076923.08,"is_new":true,"series":[{"date":"2026-09-02","value":333176923076.92},{"date":"2026-10-02","value":330023076923.08}]},"Y":{"period":"2026년","latest":1129125000000.0,"is_new":true,"series":[{"date":"2026-09-02","value":1130750000000.0},{"date":"2026-10-02","value":1129125000000.0}]}},"briefing":{"briefing":"최근 베트남에서 8,400억 원 규모의 가스복합발전소 수주 소식이 있었지만, 주가는 하락세를 보였습니다. 이는 시장의 전반적인 불안감이나 투자자들의 매도세가 영향을 미쳤을 가능성이 있습니다.","content_url":"https://news.kbs.co.kr/news/pc/view/view.do?ncd=8676463&ref=A","article_title":"두산에너빌, 8,400억 규모 베트남 가스복합발전소 수주","change_rate":-1.218},"stk_flow":[{"date":"2026-10-02","외인":-41412718000,"개인":47593767000,"기관":-7105889000},{"date":"2026-10-01","외인":-46932929000,"개인":46954605000,"기관":-2106951000},{"date":"2026-09-30","외인":6065048000,"개인":-6088164000,"기관":-2582636000},{"date":"2026-09-29","외인":-53489281000,"개인":85367184000,"기관":-32251384000},{"date":"2026-09-28","외인":-3431274000,"개인":14549334000,"기관":-5286022000},{"date":"2026-09-23","외인":-157764764000,"개인":230973727000,"기관":-76140490000},{"date":"2026-09-22","외인":-31895231000,"개인":41824810000,"기관":-11365717000}]},{"code":"013030","name":"하이록코리아","market":"KSQ","price":36350.0,"change_pct":-0.95,"market_cap":427183627200.0,"fwd_pe":6.7384443,"fwd_pb":null,"has_chart":true,"has_new":false,"news":[],"disclosures":[],"reports":[],"consensus":{"Q":{},"Y":{}},"briefing":{"briefing":"이러한 변동에 대한 공식적인 뉴스나 발표는 아직 확인되지 않았습니다.","content_url":"nan","article_title":"nan","change_rate":-0.1376},"stk_flow":[{"date":"2026-10-02","외인":-3629000,"개인":19